<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><Bill type="bill" xmlns="http://leg.wa.gov/2012/document"><BillHeading><RequestNumber>Z-0686.1</RequestNumber><ShortBillId>SB 6131</ShortBillId><LongBillId>SENATE BILL 6131</LongBillId><Legislature>66th Legislature</Legislature><Session>2020 Regular Session</Session><Sponsors>Senators Mullet, Hobbs, Short, Wilson, L., and Das; by request of Department of Financial Institutions</Sponsors><BillHistory><PrefiledDate>Prefiled 01/03/20.</PrefiledDate><ReadDate>Read first time 01/13/20.</ReadDate><ReferredCommittee>Referred to Committee on Financial Institutions, Economic Development &amp; Trade.</ReferredCommittee></BillHistory><BriefDescription>Repealing the debenture company laws from the securities act of Washington.</BriefDescription></BillHeading>

<BillBody>
<BillTitle>AN ACT Relating to repealing the debenture company laws from the securities act of Washington; amending RCW 21.20.810; and repealing RCW 21.20.705, 21.20.710, 21.20.715, 21.20.717, 21.20.720, 21.20.725, 21.20.727, 21.20.730, 21.20.732, 21.20.734, 21.20.740, 21.20.745, 21.20.750, 21.20.805, 21.20.815, 21.20.820, 21.20.825, 21.20.830, 21.20.835, 21.20.840, 21.20.845, and 21.20.850.</BillTitle>
<EnactedClause />
<BillSection type="amendatory" action="amend">
<BillSectionHeader><BillSectionNumber><TextRun>Sec. </TextRun><Value>1</Value><TextRun>.  </TextRun></BillSectionNumber><SectionCite><TextRun>RCW </TextRun><TitleNumber>21</TitleNumber><TextRun>.</TextRun><ChapterNumber>20</ChapterNumber><TextRun>.</TextRun><SectionNumber>810</SectionNumber></SectionCite> and 1988 c 244 s 7 are each amended to read as follows:<Caption>Application of chapter not limited.</Caption></BillSectionHeader>
<P>Nothing in RCW 21.20.700 <TextRun amendingStyle="strike">through 21.20.750 and 21.20.815 through</TextRun><TextRun amendingStyle="add">, 21.20.702, or</TextRun> 21.20.855 limits the application of other provisions of this chapter.</P>
<History>1988 c 244 § 7.</History>
<RCWNoteSection>
<AnnNote><NoteP><TextRun fontWeight="bold">Severability<TextRun fontFamily="Times New Roman">—</TextRun>Effective date<TextRun fontFamily="Times New Roman">—</TextRun>Implementation<TextRun fontFamily="Times New Roman">—</TextRun>Application<TextRun fontFamily="Times New Roman">—</TextRun>1988 c 244:</TextRun> See notes following RCW 21.20.700.</NoteP></AnnNote>
</RCWNoteSection>
</BillSection>
